        "accordion_xpgejN": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is it safe?",
            "icon": "shield",
            "use_product_description": false,
            "content": "<p>Yes. The Neera copper hammered tumbler is made from pure, food-grade copper and is safe for use as everyday drinkware.<br/><br/>Here is what you need to know:<br/>✓ Every batch is lab-tested after manufacturing for material purity<br/>- No mixed metals, no alloys, no chemical coatings of any kind<br/>✓ Use with clean, filtered, room-temperature or cool water for best results<br/>✓ Hand wash only — mild soap and lukewarm water, or lemon juice and salt for a deeper clean<br/>✓ Do not put it in Dishwasher or Refrigerator<br/>✓ Natural patina (color change or darkening) that develops over time is a normal characteristic of pure copper and is not a sign of damage or contamination<br/>✓ Not recommended for hot beverages, carbonated drinks, or acidic liquids stored for long periods<br/>✓ You might get slight metallic taste in the water once it is charged with copper<br/><br/></p>",
            "open_by_default": false
          }
        },
        "accordion_gpDM3X": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What Can I Expect?",
            "icon": "sparkles",
            "use_product_description": false,
            "content": "<p>Here is what most Neera copper drinkware owners tell us they experience day to day:<br/>✓ A noticeably clean, fresh taste from a glass that is free of plastic and chemical residue<br/>✓ A hydration ritual that feels intentional, not just a habit<br/>Inspired by the centuries-old Ayurvedic practice of drinking water stored in copper vessels, the Neera copper drinkware is designed to make your daily hydration feel like a considered choice, not an afterthought.<br/><br/>*Individual experiences vary. The Neera copper tumbler is everyday drinkware. These statements have not been evaluated by the FDA and are not intended as medical claims.<br/><br/></p>",
            "open_by_default": false
          }
        },
        "accordion_EFb7YW": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "Shipping & Returns",
            "icon": "truck",
            "use_product_description": false,
            "content": "<p><strong>Shipping</strong>:</p><p>✓   All Cleo orders ship within 1–2 business days from our USA warehouses</p><p>✓    Standard delivery: 3–5 business days across the USA</p><p><strong>Returns</strong>:</p><p> If you are not satisfied with your copper water bottle, you may return<br/>it in its original, unused condition within 7 days of delivery</p><p>✓    To start a return, contact our support team at <a href=\"mailto:Hello@cleolifestyle.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"mailto:Hello@cleolifestyle.com\">Hello@cleolifestyle.com</a></p><p>✓   Refunds are processed within 5–7 business days of receiving the return</p>",
            "open_by_default": false
          }
        },
        "accordion_yVYtTC": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Our Promise To You",
            "icon": "heart",
            "use_product_description": false,
            "content": "<p>✓   We built Neera around one idea that everyday drinkware should be made with natural materials, craftsmanship, and integrity.</p><p>✓   All Neera Products are Good for you and Better for the planet.</p><p>✓   We are a small brand that takes every order seriously. If something is not right with your Neera product when it arrives,<br/>reach out to us and we will make it right, no run-around, no hassle.</p><p>That is the Neera promise.<br/><br/>*<strong> Information on this page is for general wellness and lifestyle purposes only and is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent anydisease</strong>.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false
          }
        }
